---

Model weights are NOT bundled with this package. The perception sidecar uses
Ultralytics YOLO11 (yolo11n.pt / yolo11n-pose.pt), which are distributed under
AGPL-3.0: https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/blob/main/LICENSE
The sidecar looks for them under `models/`, then under the Ultralytics cache,
and can also fetch them on first run. If you redistribute those weights or run
them as a network service, review that licence first.
